\lesssim & (\textnormal{cost}(P,A)/m) \cdot \textnormal{cost}(P,S). \tag{\cref{lem: event-e-coreset-cost}, $A$ is a $O(1)$-approx}
\end{align}
This completes the proof of the lemma.

